    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi Idle is an progression based Idle game of which features Modules with individuality that excel when cooperating with each other. With a large focus on customization, enjoy a highly randomized item generation system that has the potential to generate exceedingly strong equipment. An expanding passive tree featuring over 300 nodes in its Beta. All with the purpose of making your fighters super strong, to push even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi Idle has a large focus on giving the player the power to control how they play. Each rebirth unlocks more content and more ways to change the playstyle of your game. Revisit old strategies reborn anew or focus more on a part of the game that you have been meaning to bring up to speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/8d1cf63c874e4cc26bd09fc0ddb5068e.poster.avif?t=1737587369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/8d1cf63c874e4cc26bd09fc0ddb5068e.webm?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/8d1cf63c874e4cc26bd09fc0ddb5068e.mp4?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>There are a number of races and classes for various benefits. And through advantages and game based evolutions that modify the way the game can be played. As well as the powerful inventory and passive tree. There is a large amount of ways to customize a run to the play style of your choosing. Or even just to focus on parts of the game that may be lacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/7f9ec8fdf41aa5dad5940006c350573d.poster.avif?t=1737587369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/7f9ec8fdf41aa5dad5940006c350573d.webm?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/7f9ec8fdf41aa5dad5940006c350573d.mp4?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Go on Expeditions and fight for loot! But be ready for the next step in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/3a2176f8010c396e266402f7f374bdf9.poster.avif?t=1737587369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/3a2176f8010c396e266402f7f374bdf9.webm?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/3a2176f8010c396e266402f7f374bdf9.mp4?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>To go further, fight with a more advanced form of combat with Magic, Skills, and opponents that will hit back hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things to Do</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade </strong>- We all love getting upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore </strong>- Gather valuable resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expedition </strong>- Get the loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeons</strong> - Put your might to the test and fight strong enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kingdom</strong> - Build a kingdom by governing how it's constructed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Projects and Jobs</strong> - Govern the focus of your population.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Totems </strong>- Construct totems to empower your play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quests</strong> - Get bounties with rewards to defeat the monsters you're already defeating!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With even more stuff, like a large passive tree and various customizability. Multi idle accommodates the many screens by allowing you to see multiple sections of the game all at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roadmap:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arena</strong> - Somewhat already working, involving online PvP Fighter configurations with betting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raids</strong> - Use all 3 of your characters as a party against very strong bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cards</strong> - A field of cards that need to be strategically placed for maximum benefit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wonders</strong> - Have your population build wonders of great rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space and Worlds</strong> - Push further, to space and beyond. Build spaceships and explore other worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/9ef434dde5fbb5cc033e5a84984c645e.poster.avif?t=1737587369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/9ef434dde5fbb5cc033e5a84984c645e.webm?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882880/extras/9ef434dde5fbb5cc033e5a84984c645e.mp4?t=1737587369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
